<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 3.906 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 3.906 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 3.906 billion pesos in the secondary market on Wednesday through three credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    1.053 bln  14 days</p>
<p>    1.053 bln  13 days</p>
<p>    1.800 bln   1 day</p>
<p>Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
